# Flanking (CR 702.25a): Benalish Cavalry (2/2) attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's Balduvian Bears (2/2, no flanking) blocks it. Blocking
# triggers flanking (CR 509.3d), so the Bears get -1/-1 until end of turn: a 1/1 that deals only 1 damage and dies to the Cavalry's
# 2, while the Cavalry (2 toughness) survives with 1 damage marked. Without flanking both 2/2s would die.

